><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1396" width="2492" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel-title0-0" value="T  실제 reviewed target" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="72" y="187" width="2468" height="35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel-title1-0" value="A  대안 구조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1336" y="187" width="1204" height="35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-0" value="박스: Component, 서브시스템, 논리 실행체 또는 저장소 이름 / 번호 화살표: 동작과 순서 / 검정: 공통 / 파랑: 달라지는 구조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1324" width="2492" height="28" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-note-0" value="차이: current-Turn-only 요청은 S2S VoiceProposal을 좁은 직접 경로로 처리할 수 있다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="88" y="1242" width="2452" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-note-1" value="개인 자료, 화면, Task 또는 과거 대화가 필요하면 ④의 Core 경로로 들어간다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="88" y="1270" width="2452" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-note-0" value="차이: VoiceProposal 직접 경로와 speculative S2S 생성을 제거한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="1242" width="1188" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-note-1" value="S2S 직접 기능은 미지원이며, 승인 Text와 SpeechRender로 음성 응답을 만든다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="1270" width="1188" height="25" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
